X|Terminal rendering, Canvas width math, dashboard layout
X|ProcessRunner timeouts and lease mechanics
X|Adding a test framework such as xunit
X|Changing the agent prompt wording beyond what the verdict fix requires
U|Whether git on the target machine supports --porcelain=v1 -z with -uall in one invocation; if not, fall back to a parser that handles quoted C-style paths and say so in the report.
